{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1000_p", "source_sha256": "716c67585962977c501d1c0174ec94df3c0c3fdcb6f120039a618772f7322c4d", "ja": "（今日は瑞希のPV撮影！　瑞希は準備段階から、\nかなり気合いが入っている様子だったが……）", "zh": "（今天是瑞希的PV拍摄日！瑞希从准备阶段开始，就一直干劲十足的样子，可是……）", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1001_044miz", "source_sha256": "112e924606e61fd16660bb635dca5ed78c3788204e95ed4cbd51274a82773acf", "ja": "……。\n……………………ぐう。", "zh": "……。\n……………………呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1002_p", "source_sha256": "dbbbbc08c5013df47503e8fbbb2e41277d5962904faa64d922b5d7799f3c46b2", "ja": "おーい、瑞……あれ？　寝てるのか。", "zh": "喂，瑞……咦？睡着了吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1003_044miz", "source_sha256": "fc1d85a36eca9e6dc8f48e81369969ededd295323cfdcc3d0e445384815944ff", "ja": "……。はっ、{$P$}。\n違います。寝ていたのではなく、精神統一を。", "zh": "……。啊，{$P$}。\n不是的。我刚才并不是睡着了，而是在集中精神。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1004_044miz", "source_sha256": "f3a5a3d8851641264adf031f0ce93d5da69acf41c5c4a8b3921a7b0172f6b178", "ja": "……。すみません、嘘です。完全に寝ていました。\n正直者でいたい、真壁瑞希です。", "zh": "……。对不起，我说谎了。我确实彻底睡着了。\n想要做个诚实的人，我是真壁瑞希。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1005_p", "source_sha256": "3ae2a982199450982345c9e35f58fea8b9cab6da550d0b7015f20181f22d0c77", "ja": "あ、うん……正直に言ってくれてありがとう。\nでも、どうしてそんなに眠そうなんだ？", "zh": "啊，嗯……谢谢你坦率地告诉我。\n不过，你怎么这么困啊？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1006_044miz", "source_sha256": "a632a3fd0db6a7658b4baa91bba4a2b1786cd25aea24ecf532e3aed9cf9c8cd7", "ja": "それは……今日撮る、PVのためです。\nゲームがテーマの、バトル物……ですよね？", "zh": "那是因为……今天要拍的PV。\n是以游戏为主题的战斗类型……对吧？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1007_p", "source_sha256": "3ae48cf98fc67b6b8a1610a953f6ad3993672de5f70a02313abaf254f619d096", "ja": "そうだな。ド派手なアクションがウリの、\nカッコイイPVになる予定だ。", "zh": "没错。预定会拍成一支以华丽动作场面为卖点的帅气PV。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1008_044miz", "source_sha256": "ec45a5f3adee885da27077bac1f3c18f0d6cf1e5d6a20ddca43e72a05577f7bf", "ja": "はい。なので参考のため、望月さんに\nオススメのゲームを教えてもらったのですが……。", "zh": "是的。所以为了参考，我请望月同学给我推荐了游戏……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1009_044miz", "source_sha256": "a173ea47d41a6107eae2f71571ef9327f99165f02403d649a1786d64601ecafb", "ja": "つい、夢中になってやってしまって、\n夜更かしを……一生の不覚。", "zh": "一不小心就玩得太入迷，熬了夜……真是一生的失策。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1010_p", "source_sha256": "b7ab9aa4d0d00d1fa407721a1230df9326c4234250a1062cf1d78f0d14ab9a52", "ja": "なるほど、それで寝不足か……。\nよっぽど面白いゲームだったんだな。", "zh": "原来如此，所以才睡眠不足啊……一定是个相当有趣的游戏吧。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1011_044miz", "source_sha256": "1112cd74287392dfaa497212941de12c86848c9fa956ec3e04ab6ca1bbffce93", "ja": "はい、望月さんが太鼓判を押すだけはあります。\n特に、パーティープレイが楽しくて。", "zh": "是的，确实值得望月小姐郑重推荐。尤其是多人一起玩，特别有意思。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1012_044miz", "source_sha256": "1653c9eeb3cb348b87b2455517c944bbd6b903cb58d8bc8c29bf94171819ae37", "ja": "この前、望月さんの家で、みんなと遊んだのですが。\nすっかりハマりました……ズブズブ。", "zh": "前阵子在望月小姐家和大家一起玩了，结果彻底上瘾了……越陷越深。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1013_044miz", "source_sha256": "fb224edfb90b0f10d0edce367fd205b489d283b6bef9b2d2c1cee9baed46a0a8", "ja": "ゲームのキャラも、槍使いにしました。\n伝説の槍使いとして、世界を救ってみせます。", "zh": "游戏角色也选成了使枪的职业。\n我要作为传说中的枪兵，拯救世界给你看。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1014_p", "source_sha256": "86885dc04cede88a35f88ae0ae1bcd3be0ffcb673ec5649109057e9879696c12", "ja": "まあ、楽しそうでよかったよ。\nでも寝不足で、今日の仕事は大丈夫なのか？", "zh": "哎呀，你玩得开心就好。\n不过睡眠不足，今天的工作没问题吗？", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1015_044miz", "source_sha256": "5664d05d80a9f2f7616cf20f9183d9ae18f151d87dd15bc540e5112a0bd408bf", "ja": "はい。それは問題ありません。\nさっきまでは、とても眠かったのですが……。", "zh": "是的，没问题。\n刚才我还非常困……", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1016_044miz", "source_sha256": "e23c31f4ce8af782ed66f2127398667eab7e9284e7b6e4694e149f9b52b8874a", "ja": "{$P$}に寝顔を見られたことで、\n眠気が吹っ飛びました。ドキドキ。", "zh": "因为睡相被{$P$}看到了，\n困意一下子全飞走了。心跳加速。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1017_p", "source_sha256": "cb12d3e704fc7962e37c31964c86379c37343ff701d32cf5d180a75f49abba15", "ja": "それならいいけど……。\nじゃあ、よろしく頼んだぞ！", "zh": "那就好……。\n那么，就拜托你了！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1018_044miz", "source_sha256": "d292dbc7dbcf2a254d7b54546de5fde2fe95902242a20b4f11cf3b94d23eeba0", "ja": "はい。ゲームキャラの私は、今すぐには\nお見せできませんが……代わりに、リアルの私を。", "zh": "是的。游戏角色的我，现在还没法立刻给您看……不过，可以先看看现实中的我。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1019_044miz", "source_sha256": "7bac5997dfa32c24ad010cc47edb1c5768fa221fa14dc37d35aa7d8ec31f93db", "ja": "イメトレならバッチリです。本番では、\n華麗な槍さばきをお見せしましょう……ぶんぶん。", "zh": "想象训练已经做好了。正式演出时，就让您见识一下华丽的长枪技艺吧……呼呼。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1020_p", "source_sha256": "0d9b99fc0ccb8ea2aefc56d357d74f41e2aa9ef685276bd296adc0fe9f74f745", "ja": "楽しみにしてるよ。でも、長物を使うから\n気を付けて。ケガしないようにな。", "zh": "我很期待。不过你要用长兵器，注意安全。别受伤了。", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
{"asset_version": "1077500", "client_version": null, "source_client_version": "9.0.200", "bundle": "card_episode_044miz0284_jp.gtx", "item_key": "card_episode_044miz0284_1021_044miz", "source_sha256": "e8ab6c80ceebba8626552d0b4659eb46190c67eb83d873e22aeaff48c262d48a", "ja": "大丈夫です。万が一ケガをしたら、\n回復薬を使います。いざ……突撃！", "zh": "没问题。万一受伤了，\n就使用回复药。那么……冲锋！", "status": "accepted", "updated_at": "2026-09-27T00:00:00Z"}
